WEBVTT

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:05.480
Jumpei!

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.880
What, you actually went 
to morning chorus practice?

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:09.760
Seriously?

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.060
No way!

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.860
He's here, you know. He's actually here!

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:14.770
The transfer student no one's seen yet.

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:15.870
Luou-kun!

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:28.630
Mori Luou

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.900
This is Mori Luou-kun.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.950
What a pretty name.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:29.890
It's read differently,

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:33.460
but it evokes the image of a Japanese
 bush warbler calling out as it flies,

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:35.010
and is a symbol of spring.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:40.170
People have always loved its song.

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:43.720
Murao!

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:45.570
Your classroom's over here!

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:48.020
Homeroom's about to start!

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:51.520
What is he doing?

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:54.030
Wait, was that Jumpei?

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:57.030
He came just to see him?

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:01.950
<i>Crap...</i>

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:05.720
<i>Everyone's gonna find out 
that I do ballet...</i>

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:41.010
Act 3: "What Does It Mean to Be Manly?"

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:41.010
Mori-kun, would you care to say a few words?

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:43.750
No, not really...

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:44.560
Huh?

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:46.350
He's so quiet!

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:58.490
Let's see... Mori, can you solve this?

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:01.900
No, I can't.

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.120
Gifted with both beauty and intelligence 
Ups and downs of life 
 Surrounded by enemies on all sides 
 Quiet retired life in the countryside

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:04.380
Mori-kun.

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:06.120
Can you read this?

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:08.620
No, I can't.

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:11.850
Is he being rebellious?

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:14.530
Or is he really just dumb?

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:17.880
Okay, for this passage...

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.130
Mori-kun, please read it aloud.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:24.190
"My favorite sport is basketball.

00:03:24.190 --> 00:03:27.330
Now I am on the school basketball team.

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:30.650
Our team has two practices a week."

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:33.900
Wow, your pronunciation 
is better than mine.

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:37.790
Hey, Mori-kun, did you just 
get back from living abroad?

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:39.530
You couldn't read kanji earlier!

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:46.040
Huh? Hey, are you ignoring me?

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:48.110
Hey!

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.540
<b>Soccer Club</b>

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:54.240
Hey!

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:57.740
Hey, Jumpei, you came to get a peek 
at the transfer student, didn't you?

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:01.330
I'll bet you're curious since
 he lives with Godai-san.

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:02.800
That's not it!

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:06.680
<i>Looks like no one's figured out 
that I do ballet yet...</i>

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.930
What's with that guy, anyway?

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:11.380
He doesn't respond, 
even when I ask him a question.

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:19.740
It's obvious that I'd make a 
better prince than him, right?

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:23.610
What part of this little 
wild monkey is a noble?

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:29.620
I know, right? I can't be friends 
with someone like him.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:35.350
How would you know? 
You've never even talked to him.

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:36.740
Huh? I can just tell!

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:39.610
My instinct for this kinda stuff is great!

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:45.710
I agree... He's not the type 
you can be friends with.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:54.930
Luou-kun! Hey!

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:00.900
What, ignoring me again?

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:04.560
Or do you not understand Japanese?

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:06.110
Good moaning!

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:09.440
Hey, good moaning!

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:13.400
Maybe it's 'cause your pronunciation's
 trash. Good <i>moaning</i>?

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:16.330
Moaning, moaning!

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.510
Moaning, mo, moaning?

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:37.360
<i>He's been coming to school 
for a few days now,</i>

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:40.370
<i>but it looks like he hasn't told
 anyone about me doing ballet.</i>

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:45.630
<i>Or is it because he doesn't actually 
recognize what I'm doing as ballet?</i>

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.030
<i>Oh, Hyou-chan.</i>

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:53.470
This is apple! Apple!

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:56.170
This is a pen!

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:57.530
This is apple.

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:02.940
Oh, great. It's started now.

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:04.680
Apple and pen!

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:08.800
When you hit "like" the other day, 
Hyou-chan's eyes shone.

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:10.770
Huh? What?!

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:13.240
Well, Hyou-chan's had 
stress building up, too.

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:14.810
Y'know, since his family's so strict?

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:19.470
And Luou-kun has that
weirdly hostile attitude,

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:17.380
How are you?

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:21.330
I'm fine, thank you, thank you!

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:21.330
but he doesn't retaliate...

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:23.860
Makes him easy prey.

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:27.160
<i>Huh?</i>

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:27.570
Okay!

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:36.080
<i>Was he like that before, too?</i>

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.620
<i>When I saw him in the studio, he acted...</i>

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:41.430
<i>bolder.</i>

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:45.000
<i>With just one stroke of his arm, 
he could tell a story...</i>

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:50.510
A festival dance?

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:55.510
<i>Man, is this the difference it makes 
when you started out young?</i>

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:58.680
<i>It's only if you can throw 
everything else away.</i>

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:03.900
<i>If I throw it all away, 
then can I get that good?</i>

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:08.780
<i>My friends and my mentor 
are all important to me...</i>

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:13.300
<i>I don't want to betray them.</i>

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:31.760
I'm going now.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:37.220
Mori Luou

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:37.220
Unbelievable!

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:39.210
A score of zero is amazing enough,

00:07:39.210 --> 00:07:41.620
but how do you not know 
the kanji for your own name?!

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:46.860
It's written "wandering bush warbler," right?

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.110
Luou

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:47.520
Luou

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:49.690
Huh?

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:50.740
What's up?

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.860
Some actress came up in the search.

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.990
Who was she again?

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:02.850
Huh?

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.460
<b>Soccer Club</b>

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:10.460
Damn that Luou! I'm gonna kill him!

00:08:11.730 --> 00:08:16.220
Yeah, I mean, your phone screen's shattered, 
<i>and</i> they called your parents.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:17.800
Bastard!

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:19.310
It's not funny!

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:22.520
You bastard! You try living
 with a busted phone!

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:22.790
<i>What the heck did he do that for?</i>

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:23.470
Not my problem.

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:25.060
<i>Now it's even harder for me to go to ballet.</i>

00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:27.460
They even called my parents, you asshole!

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:28.920
Why'd that robotic guy suddenly 
get pissed, anyway?

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:28.920
I can't breathe!

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:30.320
How should I know?!

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:32.890
When I did a search for "Luou," 
some actress came up...

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:34.400
Wait, let me borrow your phone.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:36.880
"Mori...

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:39.230
Mazuru."

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:49.400
You look just like a young Mori Mazuru!

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:50.550
Way too much like her!

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:51.550
Wow...

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.420
<b>Mori Mazuru's Scandalous Past?!</b>

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.420
<b></b>A few years after the 
scandal-ridden but talented 
actress went abroad to revive 
her career, she made 
a comeback as an actress
 in the U.S. 

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.420
<b><b> Mori Mazuru (in her idol days)</b></b>

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.420
<b></b>Her mother in Japan is taking care of the child? 
Named "Luou" (according to Mori Mazuru's blog)

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:55.180
<b></b>Named "Luou" 
(according to Mori Mazuru's blog)

00:08:55.810 --> 00:09:00.800
<i>Despite all her scandals, she publicized 
her kid's super-unique name?</i>

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:02.680
<i>What a total dumbass!</i>

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:05.940
<i>It's tough to have stupid parents...</i>

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:07.690
Jumpei!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:10.320
Look! It's Mori Mazuru's DNA!

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:19.070
Sing that one song!

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:22.790
You know, your mom's debut song, 
"More❤︎Gummy Gummy Chocolicious"!

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:24.810
C'mon, please?

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:29.790
I wanna hear it once. 
C'mon, you know it, right?

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:28.840
<i>It's not like I </i>have<i> to save him.</i>

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:30.610
<i>I don't even like him.</i>

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:32.420
C'mon, please!

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:42.490
Hey, do you have a minute?

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:44.390
Sorry, I'm in a hurry.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:45.830
Wai—

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:49.100
Are you mad about Luou-kun?

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:52.670
It's not like it makes a 
difference to me or anything,

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:55.270
but what if he just went 
back to staying home?

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:02.370
<i>Speaking of which,</i>

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:06.240
<i>she's stopped asking me why 
I'm not going to ballet, too...</i>

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:10.880
<b>Godai Ballet Studio</b>

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:10.880
Reach your hands as far as you can.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.310
Keep your backs flat.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:17.350
Pretend you have a plate on your back.

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:20.820
<i>No way... I was just passing by...</i>

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:19.290
Don't stick your butt out.

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:28.160
Lift your back up high.

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:29.190
Higher.

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:32.560
Look at the ceiling with
 your bellybutton eye.

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:33.230
<i>What did I expect?</i>

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:34.050
Higher.

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.720
<i>They've already got Luou.</i>

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:35.440
Yes, higher, higher.

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:42.890
Luou-kun's joining the club!

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:44.200
Yeah!

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:49.830
That guy's boring.

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:51.690
He doesn't react.

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:53.590
He's just got a famous mom.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:11:00.030
Hear that? Jumpei says you gotta do
 something funny to join the club.

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:01.340
Watch this, Jumpei.

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:03.260
Hey.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:04.680
Take this!

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:11.410
Did you see that reaction?!

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:13.230
What a scaredy-cat!

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:16.030
<i>H-He's so lame.</i>

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:18.570
<i>He's honestly just super lame.</i>

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:21.190
Do it again! I wanna film it!

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:22.900
All right!

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.280
All right, watch this!

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:29.330
Hey, hey, hey!

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:32.250
Here it comes!

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:35.150
Yeah, you got him!

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:35.960
You can do it!

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:36.960
More, more!

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:38.590
This is hard for us, too!

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:39.970
This is hilarious!

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.280
Don't you wanna be a starter?

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:42.050
Hey!

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.210
What is wrong with you?!

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:55.810
I'm getting a teacher!

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:00.410
Come on, Jumpei.

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:03.280
you can't try out your 
Jeet Kune Do on your friend.

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:06.380
Come on, it's time for club.

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:08.500
We gotta change! Door closing!

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:26.150
Hey, wait!

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:29.110
Hey! What's with that guy?

00:12:29.110 --> 00:12:30.540
Why is he like that?

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:31.840
Is he dumb?

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:42.690
It's because Luou only has ballet.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:49.510
You have relationships 
you need to protect, right?

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.380
Relationships more important than ballet...

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:02.130
<i>I felt kinda bad for him, but I've had it.</i>

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:06.070
<i>I don't care about that lame...</i>

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:11.970
Ow...

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:16.410
<i>I choose to be cool.</i>

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:20.280
<i>I choose to be manly...</i>

00:13:22.220 --> 00:13:25.100
<i>As I dance in secret...</i>

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:30.460
<i>What does it mean to be cool?</i>

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:32.330
<i>To be manly?</i>

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:37.000
<b><b>Hyouta (Soccer Club Second-Years): 
</b>I just had a great idea</b>

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:40.490
Gummy gummy, yummy yummy, ocean of love-y

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:43.710
Choco, choco, choco, it's just so delicious

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:48.350
It's somehow not sweet enough

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:49.640
Give me all of it

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:52.390
<i>Gummy gummy, yummy yummy, flavor of love-y</i>

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:52.390
<i>Oh, she has ballet hands...</i>

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:55.880
<i>Choco, choco, choco, it's just so fabulous</i>

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:57.270
Do you think Class 1 will sing this 
during the choral competition today?

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:58.650
As if.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:02.270
Everyone, head to the gym!

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.160
Come on, don't just sit there!

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:09.500
Boys, hurry up!

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:11.030
<i>You have relationships 
you need to protect, right?</i>

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:11.030
Hurry up and go outside!

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:13.200
From now on,

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:16.270
you need to protect your 
big sister and your mom.

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:17.960
You're the man of the house now.

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:19.470
<i>Ballet?</i>

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:21.770
<b>Mito Yukino</b>

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:22.280
<b>Fukiishi Kazuko</b>

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:22.670
<b>Invited by Brute Lee</b>

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:22.670
<b>Director
 Takehara Naoto</b>

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:22.670
<b>Stunt Coordinator
 Murao Ippeita</b>

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:22.670
<i>...more manly...</i>

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:22.670
<b>Starring Natsuji Akio</b>

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:34.400
<i>Dad, am I being manly right now?</i>

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:42.190
Next is Class 2-1, singing "Daichi Sanshou."

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:48.060
Uh... Class 2-1?

00:14:54.220 --> 00:14:55.430
What?

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:57.040
What's going on?

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:58.980
Is it coming from the broadcast studio?

00:14:57.710 --> 00:15:00.690
<i>Girls' fleeting emotions</i>

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:01.930
Oh, it's "More❤︎Gummy 
Gummy Chocolicious"!

00:15:00.690 --> 00:15:02.540
<i>From time immemorial</i>

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:09.400
<i>Have been entrusted to sweets</i>

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:11.410
What is happening?

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:12.430
<i>Even if they're high in 
calories (I don't care)</i>

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:15.330
<i>Even if I get fat (I don't care)</i>

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:19.100
<i>I'll give you the best, melting-est sweets</i>

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:17.700
Hey, what is this?

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:19.420
Wh-What's with that guy?

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:21.630
<i>(Ah) So...</i>

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:20.560
He's a guy, right?

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:23.690
Representing Class 2-1, it's Mori Mazuru,

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:24.620
<i>Gummy gummy, yummy yummy, ocean of love-y</i>

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:27.190
singing "More❤︎Gummy Gummy Chocolicious"!

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:27.750
<i>Choco, choco, choco, it's just so delicious</i>

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:32.350
<i>It's somehow not sweet enough</i>

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:31.700
Sing, Mazuru-chan!

00:15:32.350 --> 00:15:33.810
<i>Give me all of it</i>

00:15:32.350 --> 00:15:35.480
Sing! Sing!

00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:36.610
<i>Gummy gummy, yummy yummy, flavor of love-y</i>

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:40.210
Sing! Sing! Sing!

00:15:36.610 --> 00:15:39.770
<i>Choco, choco, choco, it's just so fabulous</i>

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:42.510
<i>As little as the tears 
of a sparrow (chirp!)</i>

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:47.640
Sing! Sing! Sing! Sing!

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:44.560
<i>The size of a cat's forehead (meow!)</i>

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:47.000
<i>I want more, sweet party</i>

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:50.290
<i>More (more) more (more)</i>

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:50.610
Sing! Sing! Sing! Sing!

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:55.080
<i>More (more) I want more, sweet party</i>

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:53.720
Called it. I knew he'd do something!

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:59.760
Sing! Sing! Sing! Sing!

00:15:57.420 --> 00:16:00.520
<i>Gummy gummy, yummy yummy, ocean of love-y</i>

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:01.870
Oh, man, he looks like he's about to cry!

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:03.480
<i>Choco, choco, choco, it's just so delicious</i>

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:03.480
Sing! Sing! Sing! Sing!

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:04.580
Hey, Jumpei?

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:06.290
<i>It's somehow not sweet eno—</i>

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:07.980
All of you, to the staff room, now!

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:09.230
Oh, crap!

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:12.510
Everyone in Class 2-1, report
 to the staff room at once!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:13.610
Luou!

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:15.840
Mori-kun, you can come down now!

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.470
Lucky, you get to leave.

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:27.430
It was kind of funny.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:22.180
Whoa, he just keeps spinning.

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:23.940
Wow, what <i>is</i> that?

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:25.110
What the heck is that?

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:28.000
Isn't he Ali from <i>Le Corsaire</i>? Wow...

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.560
"Le" what? "Ali"?

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:30.530
It's a ballet.

00:17:30.530 --> 00:17:32.090
What, ballet?!

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:34.770
Seriously? That's freakin' hilarious!

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:37.010
I heard Godai's mom runs a ballet studio.

00:17:37.010 --> 00:17:38.990
That doesn't mean he's gotta do it!

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.470
Ballet? Why?

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:42.990
He's a guy!

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:44.630
Right, Jumpei?

00:17:44.630 --> 00:17:45.750
Huh?!

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:54.580
What? Huh? Wait, no way. Why are you...

00:17:55.190 --> 00:17:56.880
<i>Damn it...</i>

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:06.730
Luou!

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:10.520
You looked like you were having fun!

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:12.980
Like how you danced when you were little!

00:18:17.310 --> 00:18:20.660
No, it was even more fun than that...

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:35.540
Oh, you planning on going home already?

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:38.560
You were amazing today!

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:41.300
Do your dance again! I'll film it this time.

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:44.430
I bought tights, too, so wear just these.

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.430
<b></b>Beautiful Legs 
Stockings

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.770
Come on, let's go to the club room.

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:51.710
These are pantyhose.

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:52.980
Hey, Jumpei.

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:55.730
Y'know what?

00:18:56.550 --> 00:18:57.710
Don't put them on.

00:18:57.710 --> 00:18:59.740
Leave him alone.

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:02.920
<i>I'll </i>dance instead.

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:05.530
You look like him!

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:07.750
You just love copying people, huh?

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:12.750
I'm learning ballet, too.

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:14.250
Huh?

00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:17.470
He was amazing earlier, wasn't he?

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:19.390
I might hate him,

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:23.140
but when he's made fun of, I just...

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:25.240
can't take it.

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:27.400
It's a drag. It's lame.

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:30.890
I suck... at ballet!

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:34.650
But I wanna get better.

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:38.950
That's why...

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:45.160
I'm quitting the soccer club,

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:47.280
and I can't start a band 
with you, Hyou-chan.

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:53.200
What? I don't get it.

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:55.170
What're you talking about out of nowhere?

00:19:55.490 --> 00:19:57.230
It's not out of nowhere.

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:59.420
I've always wanted to do ballet.

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:02.650
I don't know why, either.

00:20:02.650 --> 00:20:05.180
But I'm always thinking about it.

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:09.680
I'd always hoped I was just imagining it.

00:20:10.340 --> 00:20:14.400
I wanted to show everyone how manly I was.

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:15.690
But...

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:18.190
<i>Being "manly"...</i>

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:21.190
<i>Being "cool"...</i>

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.500
<i>means being able to stick to my beliefs!</i>

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:27.170
I want to get serious and
 work hard at ballet!

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:30.350
<i>If I can do that, then let them laugh at me!</i>

00:20:36.230 --> 00:20:37.620
Hyou-chan...

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:39.650
Ugh, that pisses me off.

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:42.490
Guess we're a crappy soccer team
 who don't take it seriously,

00:20:42.490 --> 00:20:44.680
and he doesn't have time 
to hang out with us.

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:46.610
I didn't say that—

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:47.550
Jumpei!

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:51.820
Y'know, I really don't get 
why you're doing ballet,

00:20:51.820 --> 00:20:54.690
and when you say you're gonna
 quit the club because of it,

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:56.640
it's like, "What the hell?"

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:18.210
<b>No members</b>

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:18.210
<b><b>Hyouta</b></b>

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:18.210
<b></b>Jumpei says he's
 quitting the club

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:18.210
<b>Nakamura</b>

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:18.210
<b></b>lmao

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:18.210
<b>Nakamura</b>

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:18.210
<b><b>Hyouta removed Jumpei
 from the group.</b></b>

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:21.900
Now...

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:30.100
<b>Godai Ballet Studio</b>

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:41.240
Oh? And who might you be?

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:42.860
I'm going to call the police.

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:46.460
Wait, old lady—I mean, Teacher!

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:52.120
Please teach me ballet!

00:21:54.230 --> 00:21:55.320
Idiot!

00:21:55.320 --> 00:21:57.500
When have you ever seen a prince 
with a shaved head?!

00:21:57.790 --> 00:22:02.970
Wh-What?!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:35.970
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:39.430
I can't stop!

00:23:39.430 --> 00:23:42.100
If I stop, I'll die!

00:23:42.440 --> 00:23:48.030
<i>Dance Dance Danseur,</i> Act 4: 
"I Can Do Ballet Now"!

00:23:44.810 --> 00:23:49.990
Act 4 
"I Can Do Ballet Now"
